# Force LF line endings on everything text-based, no matter what platform
# commits it. iklwa-trainer.sh and the other .sh files here have to run on
# Kali/Linux -- if a Windows commit ever introduces CRLF line endings, the
# shebang line breaks with "/usr/bin/env bash^M: bad interpreter" and every
# script in this repo stops running until someone notices why. This is the
# one-time fix that makes that impossible.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.sh text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.example text eol=lf
